# <type>(<scope>): <descrição curta no imperativo>
#
# Tipos comuns: feat, fix, docs, chore, refactor, perf, test, ci, build, revert
# Scopes (exemplos): ingestion, providers, db, search, api, ui, opds, infra, roadmap
#
# Corpo (opcional):
# - Contexto / por quê
# - Impacto / risco
# - Performance (hot paths)
#
# Breaking changes:
# - use ! no header (ex.: feat(api)!: ...) ou footer "BREAKING CHANGE: ..."

